                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[2d indorsement.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Headquarters Military Division Missouri</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                rendition="#italic">Chicago</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1880-06-10"><hi rendition="#italic">June</hi>
                            10, 1880</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Respectfully forwarded to the Adjutant-General of the Army.</p>
                <p>In the absence of the Lieutenant-General commanding.</p>
                <closer><signed>M. V. SHERIDAN,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Lieutenant-Colonel, and
                            Military Secretary.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
